            "notes": "One curator made a post about our game by writing that it's assets from the unit store. We took a project from the store to spend less time developing. I purchased this project to save myself time, and the curator Stom took it that he wrote that it is aset from the unit store and all the users who signed it negatively reacted negatively to my game. I did not release it in the form in which it is, and I'm not going to release it in this form. However, this curator entry will be displayed when I make the final version. It is for this reason that I will be forced to postpone this project to a later date and instead start developing a new game from scratch."
        },
